ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/7ea2b440356c32c180b5bfa90cb76097.webm?t=1749026719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a colorful cast of characters inspired by Baltic folklore, from mischievous witches to ethereal forest spirits and majestic pagan gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Co-funded by the MEDIA strand of the European Union\u2019s Creative Europe Programme</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/e07c0ad8bb4d8fc7eeb57df100ac5301.avif?t=1749026719\" width=250 height=83 /></span></p>",
